  "summary_en": "State Council Decree No. 845 revising China's regulations on emergency response to and investigation of electric power safety accidents, effective 1 January 2027. It sets accident tiers, reporting duties, emergency handling, investigation procedures and penalties. It contains no AI or robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
